-bold text-stone-900">Analítica</h2><p class="mt-2">La aplicación incluye Vercel Analytics para conocer el uso agregado de la web. No implementa publicidad, marketing ni píxeles publicitarios.</p><h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">Antes del lanzamiento público</h2><p class="mt-2">Antes de publicar esta web deben añadirse la identidad y los datos de contacto del responsable, una vía para ejercer derechos de privacidad, la base jurídica y los plazos de conservación aplicables. Esta información es una preparación práctica para el lanzamiento y no sustituye asesoramiento legal.</p></template><template v-else><p>This page gives a practical summary of how Tapas Castellón currently works. It will be updated before public launch with the controller’s details and applicable legal information.</p><h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">Accounts and access</h2><p class="mt-2">You can create an account with an email address and password, or sign in with Google. Supabase handles authentication and the account data needed to use these features.</p><h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">Ratings and reviews</h2><p class="mt-2">When signed in, you can save ratings for bars and tapas and write tapa reviews. These contributions are stored in Supabase so the site can show ratings, reviews and rankings. Visible reviews are shown as submitted by a festival visitor; the account email address is not published with the review.</p><h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">Browser-stored preferences</h2><p class="mt-2">The “Want to try” list, language and theme preference are stored locally in your browser so they work between visits. You can remove them through your browser settings.</p><h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">Limited data collection</h2><p class="mt-2">Tapas Castellón does not display advertising. We do not maintain a marketing database or use account information for marketing. We also do not operate an IP-address moderation or tracking system.</p><p class="mt-2">The “Want to try” feature is stored only in your browser. It is not stored as part of your server-side account or profile, and remains on your device or browser until you clear your browser data.</p><h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">Analytics</h2><p class="mt-2">The application includes Vercel Analytics to understand aggregated use of the website. It does not implement advertising, marketing or advertising pixels.</p><h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">Before public launch</h2><p class="mt-2">Before this website is launched publicly, it needs the identity and contact details of the data controller, a way to exercise privacy rights, and the applicable legal basis and retention periods. This is practical launch preparation and is not legal advice.</p></template></PublicInfoLayout></template>
